{"id":"5d7578be72946d2e","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-ideal-approachability-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal Approachability Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal-approachability-ideal — ZFC Ideal Approachability Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal-approachability-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal-approachability-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal-approachability-ideal — ZFC Ideal Approachability Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-df-club]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]","[[58-df-order-type]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal-approachability-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal-approachability-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal-approachability-ideal — ZFC Ideal Approachability Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"58-df-club\">58-df-club</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"58-df-order-type\">58-df-order-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\kappa,\\vec a\\in V\">\\(I,\\kappa,\\vec a\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|{-}|\">\\(|{-}|\\)</span> is the cardinality operator (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"58-df-club\">58-df-club</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}:V\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"58-df-order-type\">58-df-order-type</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealApproachabilityIdeal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdealApproachabilityIdeal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}approachability\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcIdealApproachabilityIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa,\\vec a)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\vec a\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa)^\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\kappa\\;\n(\\vec a(\\xi)\\subseteq\\xi\\land|\\vec a(\\xi)|&lt;\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land I=\\Bigl\\{X\\subseteq\\kappa:\n\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\gamma\\in X\\cap C\\;\\exists A\\subseteq\\gamma\\;\\bigl(\n\\sup A=\\gamma\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{172pt}\\land\n\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\mathrm{cf}(\\gamma),A,\\in\\cap A^2)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\gamma\\;\\exists\\xi\\in\\gamma\\;\n(A\\cap\\beta=\\vec a(\\xi))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}approachability\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcIdealApproachabilityIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa,\\vec a)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\vec a\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa)^\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\kappa\\;\n(\\vec a(\\xi)\\subseteq\\xi\\land|\\vec a(\\xi)|&lt;\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land I=\\Bigl\\{X\\subseteq\\kappa:\n\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\gamma\\in X\\cap C\\;\\exists A\\subseteq\\gamma\\;\\bigl(\n\\sup A=\\gamma\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{172pt}\\land\n\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\mathrm{cf}(\\gamma),A,\\in\\cap A^2)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\gamma\\;\\exists\\xi\\in\\gamma\\;\n(A\\cap\\beta=\\vec a(\\xi))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the ideal generated relative to the supplied approximation sequence; every approximation is bounded below its index and has size below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Approachability is witnessed on a club by a cofinal set of order type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(\\gamma)\\)</span> whose initial segments occur in that fixed sequence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-club","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-club]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order-type","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-order-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|{-}|$ is the cardinality operator (see [[58-df-cardinality]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-regular-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-club","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt"